# earlier builds ran the glint pass unguarded, and the filter form of data modify
# appends a bare copy of the filter when nothing matches - so old worlds carry id-less
# copies of every setting after the real ones. src -> clean, first entry per index.
# `append from` a filter copies every match, hence the one item scratch list
